w), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"_YfdFmhYhaelhlQXoGCktA","review_id":"eb8x85OSDREFH41sZgdzvQ","date":"2016-01-18T02:55:10","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9229927062988281,"text_excerpt":"Petite Amelie thank you for being open late enough on a Sunday for my salad fix! This was the last stop during my NOLA weekend visit and after over indulging in everything the NOLA food scene had to offer I was craving a salad. (I know it sounds weird but too much of a good thing can be bad okay??) I had the tarragon chicken salad. It was a sizable salad with very yummy chicken salad piled on top of mixed greens (no dressing as the chicken salad made up for that). Also had crisp green apples lining the salad. I would def recommend. When we arrived there were quite a few tables and someone was working on their laptop there. It's a good spot to grab a casual and fast bite to eat or lounge a..."},{"business_id":"_YfdFmhYhaelhlQXoGCktA","review_id":"jXEtthnJ-D4qWDUXAvC6tQ","date":"2015-11-05T21:35:35","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9222806692123413,"text_excerpt":"Yum! We were only in NOLA for 72 hours and unfortunately, Cafe Amelie was booked up for a private event while we were there. So, we opted for the next best thing, breakfast at Petite Amelie. I got the brighten up juice (with carrot, ginger, spinach, and apple) which was freshly made right in front of me and the chicken and waffle panini. I know, it sounded like I was going to be healthy but then I went and got the chicken and waffle panini; hey, it's my life. The juice was bright and refreshing (though I wish it was chilled) and the sandwich was delicious. I drowned my plate in maple syrup and went to town and really enjoyed the way the cheese stretched as I tried to cut the waffle into b..."},{"business_id":"_YfdFmhYhaelhlQXoGCktA","review_id":"XUc541k-X8Gn6S3YReJqVQ","date":"2017-06-23T23:46:09","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9192492365837097,"text_excerpt":"Although prices are a bit high for the food, petite Amelie definitely justifies itself for the flavor and simplicity of its menu items. I fully enjoyed my muffaletta sandwich (Italian meats, olives, cheese) and washed it down with a strawberry (seasonal) lemonade. I also bought a pint of potato salad to share with my two friends. The decor is really cute and the cafe itself was close to our hotel and in the French quarter which was super convenient. If you're down for lunch with a Parisian flare, petite Amelie is your go to spot."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"_YfdFmhYhaelhlQXoGCktA","photo_id":"052er6Y_V3IVx7iL0yFQ4g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/052er6Y_V3IVx7iL0yFQ4g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8460158705711365},{"business_id":"_YfdFmhYhaelhlQXoGCktA","photo_id":"AdtyYpM8jqLjinyXf2YsvQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/AdtyYpM8jqLjinyXf2YsvQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8392766714096069},{"business_id":"_YfdFmhYhaelhlQXoGCktA","photo_id":"tR_McEyRa1ylGWN668uTcg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/tR_McEyRa1ylGWN668uTcg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.821967363357544},{"business_id":"_Yfd